Project Mosaic Command Centre — AI Application Build Prompt

CONTEXT

You are building a comprehensive, AI-powered Program Management Command Centre for a large-scale Oracle Fusion Cloud ERP transformation program called Project Mosaic at Emirates Group. The program:

Involves 3 Phases, 6 Drops, 40+ countries, 100+ Legal Entities

Covers modules: Financials, Procurement, SCM, HCM (incl. Payroll), EPM

Is governed by a fixed-price contract (~$36M) with Oracle

Follows Oracle True Cloud Methodology (TCM)

Has multiple go-live dates across several years

Involves two organizations: Emirates Group (client) and Oracle Consulting (SI)

Uses Emirates Jira as the defect/issue tracking tool

Has a critical milestone penalty clause (0.5%/week, 10% cap)

The primary user is the Emirates Program Manager, who needs complete situational awareness and control across all program dimensions. The application must be their single source of truth, daily operating tool, and AI advisor.

APPLICATION NAME

Project Mosaic Command Centre (PMCC)

DESIGN REQUIREMENTS

Aesthetic: Professional, premium, aviation-inspired (Emirates brand awareness). Dark navy / gold / white color palette. Clean, data-dense but not cluttered. Think mission control, not spreadsheet.

Framework: React with hooks and Tailwind CSS

Charts: Recharts for all data visualizations

Icons: Lucide React

AI Integration: Anthropic Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-20250514) for all AI features

Storage: Persistent key-value storage using window.storage API for all program data

Layout: Left sidebar navigation, main content area, right contextual panel

Responsive: Desktop-first (1440px design width)

